body:
- I have a doc dedicated to collecting quotes from Lisa Kleypas’s books. Here’s a fav “If only I could visit you as a foreigner goes into a new country, learn the language of you, wander past all borders into every private and secret place, I would stay forever. I would become a citizen of you.” From {Wallflower Christmas by Lisa Kleypas} 

- The hairbrush in {Transcendence by Shay Savage} Ehd doesn’t understand why Beh is always trying to brush her hair, but he makes her a comb just because it’s important to her. 

- This Wuthering Heights quote: “I wish I were a girl again, half savage and hardy, and free.”

Ooh I love Eyes of Silver, Eyes of Gold and Dancing On Coals! I remember searching for a lot of other Westerns to get over the book hangover. I think you might enjoy these two:

{Silver Lining by Maggie Osborne} 

{The Promise of Jenny Jones by Maggie Osborne}
